<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="363.268" endTime="364.875">
<Sync time="363.268"/>
¿Wa:n yeh yo:n no: kinamakah?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="364.875" endTime="374.711">
<Sync time="364.875"/>
Pos no: kinamakah, *cinco pesos rollito** no:.
<Sync time="368.782"/>
